Not in the repository: the EasyEDA/LCSC models of five board parts and the fan's and the servo's makers' models
(Noctua, Hitec) are their owners' and are not redistributed here. `uv run --group models scripts/fetch_models.py`
fetches or installs them (scripts/fetch_models.py lists them); everything builds and tests without them.
